Subject: [PATCH] Drop unneeded TIME_WITH_SYS_TIME conditional
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Signed-off-by: Björn Esser <besser82@fedoraproject.org>
---
 src/cookie.h | 13 ++++---------
 src/data.c   | 13 ++++---------
 src/data.h   | 13 ++++---------
 src/date.c   | 13 ++++---------
